<title>BELGIUM: EU sets periodic white/raw sugar export refunds.</title>
<headline>EU sets periodic white/raw sugar export refunds.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's sugar management committee set the two weekly periodic export refunds for white and raw sugar, an EU member state official said.</p>
<p>The rate for whites was set at 40.47 ecus per 100 kg and for raws at 35.50 ecus per 100 kg.</p>
<p>--Brussels newsroom +32 2 287-6830</p>
</text>
